B.cy2=new A.K(B.aK9,["Terms of Service and Privacy Policy","Scroll to read the full terms","Please scroll to the bottom before continuing","Welcome to AISPEECH Flash Notes. The Terms of Service and Privacy Policy explain how we collect, use, store, and share your personal information. We will not proactively share your personal information with any third party without your separate consent. You can read the third-party information sharing list and the personal information collection list for details.","Your personal information will be kept strictly confidential. AISPEECH Flash Notes will not disclose your personal information to others.","You may refuse or withdraw permissions at any time in system settings, but some features may become unavailable.","To provide AI transcription, smart summaries, key-point extraction, content polishing, Q&A, and other AI features, the app may send your voice or text to the following third-party AI service providers for processing:","The data above is used only to complete your request and will not be used for other purposes. For details, see ",".","Privacy Policy","Yundian Technology Co., Ltd. (Tongyi Qianwen)\nVolcano Engine Co., Ltd. (Doubao)\nMoonshot AI (Kimi)\nChuntian Zhiyun Technology Co., Ltd. (Coze)","OpenAI OpCo, LLC (ChatGPT)\nAnthropic, PBC (Claude)\nGoogle LLC (Gemini)","AI Feature Data Service Permission","When you use AI features such as smart summaries, key-point extraction, and content polishing, AISPEECH Flash Notes may send content you actively submit to third-party AI service providers. Processing happens only when you use the related features. Content is not sent automatically because you view a page.","Data that may be sent: ","recording transcripts, note text, file titles, and questions you enter.","Purpose: ","to generate the smart summary, key points, polished content, answers, or other AI results you request.","Service providers:","To provide you with intelligent AI services","Based on your permission, when you use AI features, we may share **on-device and cloud account data** (including recordings, notes, and to-dos) with **Tongyi Qianwen, Doubao, Kimi, and Coze** for AI features such as smart summaries, key-point extraction, and content polishing.","For details, see ",".","Deny authorization and sign out?","If you deny authorization, you will be signed out and will not be able to use AI features.\nAre you sure you want to deny authorization and sign out?"],t.w)
